# NOETIC — environment configuration
#
# The deck requires no secrets, keys, or services of any kind; it is a fully
# static build with no runtime network access. This file documents the single
# optional build-time variable.

# Base path the app is served from. Leave '/' for local dev, `vite preview`,
# or a custom domain. The GitHub Pages workflow sets:
#   VITE_BASE_PATH=/NOETIC-Cognitive-Command-Deck/
# See vite.config.ts and .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
VITE_BASE_PATH=/
